Package: mica-bled
Version: 0.0.1-1
Source-Date-Epoch: 1792368000
Architecture: @ARCH@
Maintainer: mica build <mica@example.invalid>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: passwd, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Mica OS Bluetooth LE management service
 Serves the Mica phone app over Bluetooth LE: authenticates a phone with the
 device's PIN or its enrolled credential (SPAKE2) and forwards its network
 requests to mica-apid. Carries a systemd unit and an OpenRC script and
 enables neither: micad starts it when Bluetooth is enabled.
